      "variant": "calendar features (day-of-week, month-end)",
      "phase": "D",
      "outcome": "most consistent of the three (+0.0138 mean skill, 3/4 dates positive) but decaying toward zero on the two most recent dates \u2014 consistent with a good early draw regressing to the mean rather than a real effect, rejected"
    },
